3D-PRINTABLE FRAME STRESS ANALYSIS:
  Carbon fiber PLA:
  - Tensile strength: 50-75 MPa
  - Flexural modulus: 12-15 GPa
  - Density: 1.1-1.4 g/cm³
  
  Frame bending stress: σ = M·c/I
