--- SECTION 6: CONTROL SYSTEM MATHEMATICS ---

STATE-SPACE MODEL:
  x = [height, velocity, pitch, pitch_rate, roll, roll_rate]ᵀ
  ẋ = A·x + B·u
  y = C·x + D·u
  
  Where u = [front_left_coil, front_right_coil, rear_left_coil, rear_right_coil]ᵀ

IMU SENSOR FUSION (Complementary Filter):
  θ_fused = α·(θ_gyro + ω·dt) + (1-α)·θ_accel
  α = τ/(τ + dt) [time constant τ = 0.98s typical]
  
  Mahony filter (better):
  ωcorr = ωmeas + Kp·e + Ki·∫e·dt
  θ̇ = f(q, ωcorr) [quaternion integration]

ALTITUDE HOLD (PID):
  e(t) = h_desired - h_measured
  u(t) = Kp·e + Ki·∫e·dt + Kd·ė
  
  Tuned parameters (hover bike):
  Kp = 2.5 (N per mm error)
  Ki = 0.5 (N·s per mm)
  Kd = 0.8 (N per mm/s)
  Bandwidth: 2 Hz (safe for human ride comfort)

